            "review_title": "Review at Luminus Smoothies",
            "review_text": "Del C\n2 contributions\n0\nReview abt smoothies in Luminus\nJun 2018 • Family\nThis is a healthy smoothies restaurant in Vietnam. I really like this. The first time I came here was through an online review, staff here was very friendly, welcoming and enthusiastic. Smoothies and detox here are extremely delicious and special, affordable, the process is also clean and specially good for health. There is also uses straw to protect the environment, I like this. This is a place you should visit when coming to Saigon (y)\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten July 9, 2018",
